# No build-time secrets.
#
# The Secrets Gradle Plugin was removed from this project on purpose. It generated a
# BuildConfig field for every key in .env, so GEMINI_API_KEY ended up compiled inside the
# APK, where anyone can extract it by unzipping the app and it cannot be revoked
# per-device.
#
# JARVIS now asks the user for their Gemini API key on first launch and stores it in
# EncryptedSharedPreferences on the device only.
#
# If you fork this project, get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and paste it
# into the app. Do not add it to a gradle file.
